spec.text:
{
  "id": "T-299",
  "milestone": "M2",
  "depends_on": [
    "T-298"
  ],
  "title": "The designer's page capture renders server-backed pages with fixture data and stays offline, and a worker on a prototype task can read its prototype",
  "public_title": "Capture served pages offline and let workers read their prototype",
  "scope": [
    "bin/**",
    "tests/**",
    "config.yaml",
    ".github/workflows/ci.yml",
    "design/design.md",
    "design/tasks/T-299.json"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "Why. The designer review (T-298) captures pages by opening their HTML files directly. A page that loads its content from a server, such as the captain's board, which reads `/api/events`, is captured as an empty shell, so the designer cannot see the board drift it exists to catch. The capture also runs the pull request's page scripts in a browser outside the sandbox with full network access (T-298 review follow-ups 4 and 5). The worker that ports the board (T-289) also cannot read the prototype it must port.",
    "What, served pages. A project can name how its pages are served for capture; for this repository the board pages are captured from the board server started on fixture data (the data the board's end-to-end tests already use), so the decision card, Fleet, Crew and Log pages show content. Pages with no server entry are still opened as files, as today.",
    "What, offline capture. While capturing, the browser can reach only the local machine: any request to another host is blocked and listed in the capture record, and the capture still completes.",
    "What, worker reads the prototype. A worker round of a task whose spec names a prototype in `design.prototype` can read that one prototype folder read-only, the same way the designer round does (T-298), so the worker can port its HTML and CSS directly. Today only the designer round gets it, and the worker's worktree is recreated each round, so a copy placed there is lost. No round reads any other prototype or other part of `state/`.",
    "What, browser fail-first. The machine fail-first also runs a changed browser test (`*.spec.ts`), on the head and on the base, so each browser test named under Done is shown to fail on the base; today the project's test template runs only bash suites and the fail-first job installs no browser.",
    "What, unchanged. Widths, light and dark, the prototype capture, the failed-capture rule and the designer round are unchanged.",
    "Done, tests. Tests show a server-backed board page is captured with fixture content, not an empty shell (`capture: served page has content`, fail-first); a page request to another host is blocked and recorded (`capture: remote request blocked`, fail-first); a project with no server entry still captures from files (`capture: file pages unchanged`). A worker round on a prototype task can read its prototype folder and a worker on another task cannot (`worker: prototype readable`, fail-first).",
    "Docs. The design section that describes the designer round says how served pages are captured and that capture is offline."
  ],
  "explain": {
    "en": {
      "intent": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "The capture shows server-backed pages with fixture data."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Captured pages reach only the local machine."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "A worker on a prototype task reads its prototype."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Machine fail-first also runs changed browser tests."
        }
      ],
      "why": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "The board was captured as an empty page, so the designer saw nothing."
        }
      ],
      "scope_in": [
        "page capture",
        "tests",
        "worker reads",
        "browser fail-first"
      ],
      "scope_out": [
        "the designer round",
        "the board pages"
      ],
      "done": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 1: a test shows a board page is captured with content."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 2: a test shows a remote request is blocked."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 3: a test shows the worker reads its prototype only."
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "Intent 4: the fail-first report names the browser tests that fail on the base."
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "T-289 needs this for its designer review."
        }
      ],
      "before_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Open the page"
        },
        {
          "state": "gone",
          "label": "Empty page, open network"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Screenshot"
        }
      ],
      "after_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Open the page"
        },
        {
          "state": "new",
          "label": "Fixture data, local only"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "Screenshot"
        }
      ]
    },
    "zh-TW": {
      "intent": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "截圖會顯示用測試資料載入的頁面。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "截圖中的頁面只能連本機。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "做原型任務的 worker 讀得到原型。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "機器 fail-first 也跑改到的瀏覽器測試。"
        }
      ],
      "why": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "看板截出來是空頁，設計師什麼都看不到。"
        }
      ],
      "scope_in": [
        "頁面截圖",
        "測試",
        "worker 讀取",
        "瀏覽器 fail-first"
      ],
      "scope_out": [
        "設計師審查輪",
        "看板頁面"
      ],
      "done": [
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 1：測試證明看板頁截得到內容。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 2：測試證明對外請求會擋下。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 3：測試證明 worker 只讀得到自己的原型。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact",
          "text": "意圖 4：fail-first 報告列出在舊版失敗的瀏覽器測試。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "kind": "note",
          "text": "T-289 的設計審查需要這個。"
        }
      ],
      "before_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "開啟頁面"
        },
        {
          "state": "gone",
          "label": "空頁、可連外"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "截圖"
        }
      ],
      "after_nodes": [
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "開啟頁面"
        },
        {
          "state": "new",
          "label": "測試資料、只連本機"
        },
        {
          "state": "same",
          "label": "截圖"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
